msgid "Where the logo sits at the top of every email."
msgstr "Hvor logoet sidder øverst i hver e-mail."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:581
#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-documents.php:148
#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-documents.php:174
#: inc/classes/core/class-wp-easycart-documents.php:201
msgid "Store address"
msgstr "Butiksadresse"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:582
msgid ""
"Your store’s postal address. Receipts, shipped emails and packing slips "
"print it in their footer when their profile on Settings › Documents has "
"Store address on."
msgstr ""
"Din butiks postadresse. Kvitteringer, afsendte e-mails og følgesedler "
"udskriver det i deres sidefod, når deres profil på Indstillinger › "
"Dokumenter har Store-adresse slået til."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:591
msgid "Email signature text"
msgstr "E-mail-signatur"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:592
msgid ""
"Closing text at the foot of every automatic email — your address, support "
"hours, a thank-you."
msgstr ""
"Afsluttende tekst ved foden af hver automatisk e-mail — din adresse, "
"supporttimer, et tak."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:600
msgid "Email signature image"
msgstr "Billede af e-mailsignatur"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:601
msgid ""
"Image shown under the signature text at the foot of every automatic email. "
"Choose one from the Media Library, or paste a URL."
msgstr ""
"Billede vist under signaturteksten ved foden af hver automatisk e-mail. Vælg "
"en fra mediebiblioteket, eller indsæt en webadresse."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:611
msgid "Signature image width"
msgstr "Signaturbilledbredde"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:612
msgid ""
"The widest the signature image may be, as a share of the email. 100 fills "
"the full width."
msgstr ""
"Det bredeste signaturbilledet kan være, som en del af e-mailen. 100 fylder "
"hele bredden."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:624
msgid "Signature image height limit"
msgstr "Signaturbilledhøjdegrænse"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:625
msgid "Keeps a tall image in check. 0 lets it be as tall as the width allows."
msgstr ""
"Holder et højt billede i skak. 0 lader det være så højt som bredden tillader."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:639
msgid "Order emails"
msgstr "Bestil e-mails"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:640
msgid "Receipts, invoices, refunds and store notifications"
msgstr "Kvitteringer, fakturaer, refusioner og butiksmeddelelser"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:644
msgid "Order emails come from"
msgstr "Bestillings-e-mails kommer fra"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:645
msgid ""
"The sender shoppers see on receipts, invoices and refunds. Use “Store Name "
"<orders@yourdomain.com>” to show a name. Must be on a domain you control."
msgstr ""
"Afsenderkunderne ser på kvitteringer, fakturaer og refusioner. Brug "
"\"Butiksnavn<orders@yourdomain.com>\" for at vise et navn. Skal være på et "
"domæne, du kontrollerer."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:655
msgid "Send order emails over SMTP"
msgstr "Send ordre-e-mails via SMTP"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:656
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:880
msgid ""
"The built-in mailer connects to the SMTP server below instead of using PHP "
"mail() on this server."
msgstr ""
"Den indbyggede mailer opretter forbindelse til SMTP-serveren nedenfor i "
"stedet for at bruge PHP mail() på denne server."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:665
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:889
msgid ""
"Your mail provider’s outgoing server, for example smtp.yourprovider.com."
msgstr "Din mailudbyders udgående server, f.eks. smtp.yourprovider.com."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:673
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:897
msgid "SMTP port"
msgstr "SMTP-port"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:674
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:898
msgid "Usually 465 for SSL, 587 for TLS, 25 for no encryption."
msgstr "Normalt 465 for SSL, 587 for TLS, 25 for ingen kryptering."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:685
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:909
msgid "SMTP encryption"
msgstr "SMTP Kryptering"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:686
msgid ""
"Match what your provider lists for the port above. A mismatch is the most "
"common reason SMTP sends fail."
msgstr ""
"Match, hvad din udbyder viser for porten ovenfor. En uoverensstemmelse er "
"den mest almindelige årsag til, at SMTP sender mislykkedes."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:695
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:919
msgid "SMTP username"
msgstr "SMTP brugernavn"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:696
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:920
msgid "Often the full mailbox address."
msgstr "Ofte den fulde postkasseadresse."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:703
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:927
msgid "SMTP password"
msgstr "SMTP-adgangskode"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:704
#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:928
msgid ""
"Only sent to your SMTP server. Use an app password if your provider offers "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Sendes kun til din SMTP-server. Brug en appadgangskode, hvis din udbyder "
"tilbyder en."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:711
msgid "Show the shopper’s email address on receipts"
msgstr "Vis køberens e-mailadresse på kvitteringer"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:712
msgid ""
"Adds the customer’s email address beside their order details in receipt and "
"refund emails."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer kundens e-mailadresse ved siden af deres bestillingsoplysninger i "
"kvitterings- og refusions-e-mails."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:718
msgid "Product images on receipts"
msgstr "Produktbilleder på kvitteringer"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:719
msgid ""
"Each line item shows its product image in receipt, invoice, gift card and "
"refund emails and on the printable receipt."
msgstr ""
"Hver varelinje viser sit produktbillede i kvittering, faktura, gavekort og "
"refusions-e-mails og på kvitteringen, der kan udskrives."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:726
msgid "Customer upload links in admin emails"
msgstr "Kundeupload-links i admin-e-mails"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:727
msgid ""
"Sign-in required keeps uploaded files to administrators and order managers; "
"a private link lets anyone who receives an order or product inquiry "
"notification from the store download the file until the link expires."
msgstr ""
"Påkrævet logon holder uploadede filer til administratorer og "
"ordreadministratorer. Et privat link giver alle, der modtager en ordre- "
"eller produktforespørgselsmeddelelse fra butikken, mulighed for at downloade "
"filen, indtil linket udløber."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:728
msgid ""
"Shopper receipts and the copy of an inquiry sent to the shopper never "
"include these links. Switching back to sign-in required cancels every "
"private link already sent."
msgstr ""
"Kundekvitteringer og en kopi af en forespørgsel, der sendes til kunden, "
"indeholder aldrig disse links. Hvis du skifter tilbage til login, annulleres "
"alle private links, der allerede er sendt."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:731
msgid "Sign-in required (administrators and order managers)"
msgstr "Login påkrævet (administratorer og ordreadministratorer)"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:732
msgid "Anyone with the link (expiring private link)"
msgstr "Alle med linket (udløber privat link)"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:739
msgid "Link expires after"
msgstr "Udløber efter"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:740
msgid ""
"Private links stop working after this long; shortening it also shortens "
"links already sent."
msgstr ""
"Private links holder op med at virke efter så lang tid; forkortelse af det "
"forkorter også links, der allerede er sendt."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:755
msgid ""
"Order numbers count up from here. You can only raise it — the database "
"ignores lower values."
msgstr ""
"Bestillingsnumre tæller op herfra. Du kan kun hæve den — databasen ignorerer "
"lavere værdier."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:771
msgid "Send a test order email"
msgstr "Send en e-mail med en testordre"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:779
msgid "Revoke all existing private links"
msgstr "Tilbagekald alle eksisterende private links"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:780
msgid ""
"Every customer upload link already emailed stops working at once; new order "
"emails get fresh links."
msgstr ""
"Alle kundeuploadlink, der allerede er sendt via e-mail, holder op med at "
"virke med det samme. Nye bestillings-e-mails får nye links."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:781
msgid "Revoke links"
msgstr "Tilbagekald links"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:782
msgid ""
"Revoke every private upload link sent so far? Anyone still using an old link "
"will need the order email sent again."
msgstr ""
"Vil du tilbagekalde alle private uploadlink, der er sendt indtil videre? "
"Alle, der stadig bruger et gammelt link, skal have ordre-e-mailen sendt igen."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:792
msgid "PDF invoices"
msgstr "PDF-FAKTURAER"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:794
msgid "Now set up on Settings › Documents"
msgstr "Konfigurer nu i Indstillinger › Dokumenter"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:801
msgid "Subscription emails"
msgstr "Brugeres email"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:803
msgid ""
"Send yourself the emails a subscriber gets, built from a real subscription "
"when you have one"
msgstr ""
"Send dig selv de e-mails, en abonnent får, bygget fra et rigtigt abonnement, "
"når du har et"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:808
msgid "Send test emails to"
msgstr "Send e-mails til"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:809
msgid ""
"Every \"Send test\" button on this page uses this address. Leave it empty to "
"use your own WordPress address."
msgstr ""
"Hver \"Send test \"-knap på denne side bruger denne adresse. Lad det være "
"tomt for at bruge din egen WordPress-adresse."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:822
msgid "What a subscriber gets the moment a free trial begins."
msgstr "Hvad en abonnent får i det øjeblik en gratis prøveperiode begynder."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:830
msgid "The reminder sent before a trial turns into a paid subscription."
msgstr ""
"Påmindelsen, der blev sendt før en prøveperiode, bliver til et betalt "
"abonnement."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:838
msgid ""
"The notice that a renewal payment is about to be taken, with the amount and "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Meddelelsen om, at en fornyelsesbetaling er ved at blive trukket, med beløb "
"og dato."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:846
msgid "What a subscriber gets when the subscription finishes or is cancelled."
msgstr "Hvad en abonnent får, når abonnementet afsluttes eller annulleres."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:854
msgid ""
"The \"we could not take the payment\" email. It is built from your most "
"recent order, so place a test order first if the store has none."
msgstr ""
"E-mailen \"vi kunne ikke tage imod betalingen\". Den er bygget fra din "
"seneste bestilling, så afgiv en testbestilling først, hvis butikken ikke har "
"nogen."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:863
msgid "Account emails"
msgstr "Konto e-mails"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:864
msgid "Password resets, account activation and new-account alerts"
msgstr "Nulstilling af adgangskode, kontoaktivering og advarsler om ny konto"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:868
msgid "Account emails come from"
msgstr "Konto-emails kommer fra"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:869
msgid ""
"The sender shoppers see on password reset, activation and other account "
"emails. Use “Store Name <help@yourdomain.com>” to show a name."
msgstr ""
"Afsenderkunderne kan se e-mails om nulstilling af adgangskode, aktivering og "
"andre konti. Brug \"Butiksnavn<help@yourdomain.com>\" for at vise et navn."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:879
msgid "Send account emails over SMTP"
msgstr "Send konto-emails via SMTP"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:910
msgid "Match what your provider lists for the port above."
msgstr "Match, hvad din udbyder viser for porten ovenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:935
msgid "Tell me when someone registers"
msgstr "Fortæl mig, hvornår nogen registrerer sig"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:936
msgid ""
"Sends a note to the store notification addresses each time a shopper creates "
"an account."
msgstr ""
"Sender en besked til butiksadresserne, hver gang en shopper opretter en "
"konto."

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:944
msgid "Send a test account email"
msgstr "Send en e-mail til testkontoen"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:954
msgid "Receipt wording"
msgstr "Kvitteringstekst"

#: admin/template/settings/email-setup.php:955
msgid ""
"Phrases in the order receipt email and on the order-complete page, in the "
"store language"
msgstr ""
"Sætninger i e-mailen med bestillingskvitteringen og på siden med den "
"bestilling, der er fuldført, på butikssproget"

