#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:485
msgid "Enter an amount such as 2500."
msgstr "Indtast et beløb som f.eks. 2500."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:508
#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:529
msgid "Only administrators and store managers can install or remove demo data."
msgstr ""
"Kun administratorer og butiksadministratorer kan installere eller fjerne "
"demodata."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:511
#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:532
msgid "The demo data installer is not available."
msgstr "Demodatainstallationsprogrammet er ikke tilgængeligt."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:514
msgid "Demo data is already installed."
msgstr "Demodata er allerede installeret."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:519
msgid "The demo data could not be installed."
msgstr "Demodataene kunne ikke installeres."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:535
msgid "No demo data is installed."
msgstr "Der er ikke installeret demodata."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:540
msgid "The demo data could not be removed."
msgstr "Demodataene kunne ikke fjernes."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:551
msgid "Remove the demo data"
msgstr "Fjern demodataene"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:552
msgid ""
"Deletes every demo product, category, option set, customer, order and "
"shipping rate that the installer added. Your own data is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Sletter hvert demoprodukt, kategori, indstillingssæt, kunde, ordre og "
"forsendelsespris, som installationsprogrammet tilføjede. Dine egne data "
"bliver ikke rørt."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:553
msgid "Remove demo data"
msgstr "Fjern demodata"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:554
msgid ""
"Remove all demo products, categories, customers, orders and shipping rates? "
"This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Vil du fjerne alle demoprodukter, kategorier, kunder, bestillinger og "
"forsendelsespriser? Dette kan ikke fortrydes."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:563
msgid "Install the demo data"
msgstr "Installer demodataene"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:564
msgid ""
"Adds sample clothing products, categories, option sets, a customer, orders "
"and three shipping rates so you can try the store before adding your own. "
"Everything it adds can be removed again from here."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer prøveprodukter, kategorier, indstillingssæt, en kunde, bestillinger "
"og tre forsendelsespriser, så du kan prøve butikken, før du tilføjer din "
"egen. Alt, hvad det tilføjer, kan fjernes igen herfra."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:565
#: admin/template/settings/wizard/complete.php:35
msgid "Install demo data"
msgstr "Installer demo"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:566
msgid ""
"Install the sample products, categories, customer, orders and shipping rates "
"now?"
msgstr ""
"Vil du installere prøveprodukter, kategorier, kunder, bestillinger og "
"forsendelsespriser nu?"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:576
msgid ""
"The pages your store runs on, how prices are written and your monthly sales "
"goal. The setup wizard filled these in; change them here at any time."
msgstr ""
"De sider, din butik kører på, hvordan priser skrives og dit månedlige "
"salgsmål. Opsætningsguiden udfyldte disse; skift dem her til enhver tid."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:587
#: admin/template/settings/wizard/finish.php:105
#: admin/template/settings/wizard/summary.php:113
msgid "Store pages"
msgstr "Butik sider"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:588
msgid "The three WordPress pages EasyCart needs; each holds one shortcode"
msgstr "De tre WordPress-sider EasyCart har brug for; hver har en kortkode"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:592
msgid "Setup wizard"
msgstr "Opsætningsguide"

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:601
msgid ""
"Your product catalog. Must contain the [ec_store] shortcode. Product, "
"category and manufacturer links are built under this page’s slug, so "
"changing it changes those URLs. Type to find the page."
msgstr ""
"Dit produktkatalog. Skal indeholde [ec_store] shortcode. Produkt-, kategori- "
"og producentlinks er bygget under denne sides slug, så ændring af det ændrer "
"disse webadresser. Skriv for at finde siden."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:603
#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:616
#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:628
msgid "Search pages by title…"
msgstr "Søg sider efter titel..."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:614
msgid ""
"Where shoppers review their cart and pay. Must contain the [ec_cart] "
"shortcode. Type to find the page."
msgstr ""
"Hvor shoppere gennemgår deres indkøbskurv og betaler. Skal indeholde "
"[ec_cart] kortkoden. Skriv for at finde siden."

#: admin/template/settings/initial-setup.php:626
msgid ""
"Where shoppers sign in, register and see their order history. Must contain "
"the [ec_account] shortcode. Type to find the page."
