"Amazon S3 downloads, DecoNetwork og vognimportøren."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:349
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:350
msgid ""
"GA4 ecommerce events on the storefront, plus the retired Universal Analytics "
"tag"
msgstr ""
"GA4-e-handelsbegivenheder på butiksfacaden plus det udgåede Universal "
"Analytics-tag"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:354
msgid "GA4 measurement ID"
msgstr "Måle-ID"

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:355
msgid ""
"The G-XXXXXXXXXX ID from your GA4 web data stream. Loads the Google tag on "
"store pages and sends view item, add to cart, checkout and purchase events."
msgstr ""
"G-XXXXXXXXXX ID fra din GA4 webdatastrøm. Indlæser Google-tagget på "
"butikssider og sender visningsartikel, tilføj til indkøbskurv, kassen og "
"købshændelser."

#: admin/template/settings/integrations.php:364
msgid "Send events through Google Tag Manager"
msgstr "Send begivenheder via Google Tag Manager"

