msgid ""
"Pushes the ecommerce events to the dataLayer for your Tag Manager container "
"instead of calling gtag() directly. Your container must load GA4 itself."
msgstr ""
"Skubber e-handelsbegivenhederne til datalaget for din Tag Manager-beholder i "
"stedet for at kalde gtag() direkte. Din container skal selv laste GA4."

