msgstr "Dimensionsenheder"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:704
msgid ""
"Used when product dimensions drive option pricing or are sent to a live "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Bruges, når produktdimensioner driver prissætningen af optioner eller sendes "
"til et live luftfartsselskab."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:707
msgid "Standard ( inches )"
msgstr "Standard ( tommer )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:708
msgid "Metric ( centimetres )"
msgstr "Metrisk ( centimeter )"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:720
msgid "Options at checkout"
msgstr "Muligheder ved kassen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:721
msgid "What shoppers see and can choose when shipping is charged"
msgstr "Hvad shoppere ser og kan vælge, når forsendelsen opkræves"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:725
msgid "Hide rates until an address is entered"
msgstr "Skjul priser, indtil en adresse er indtastet"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:726
msgid ""
"The cart page shows no shipping estimate; rates appear once the shopper "
"gives their address at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Indkøbskurvsiden viser ingen leveringsoverslag. Priserne vises, når kunden "
"oplyser sin adresse ved kassen."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:734
msgid "Offer free local pickup"
msgstr "Tilbyd gratis lokal afhentning"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:735
msgid "Adds a no-cost local pickup choice next to your shipping rates."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer et lokalt afhentningsvalg uden omkostninger ved siden af dine "
"forsendelsespriser."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:743
msgid "Ship to the billing address only"
msgstr "Send kun til faktureringsadressen"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:744
msgid ""
"Removes the separate shipping address form; shoppers are told orders go to "
"their billing address."
msgstr ""
"Fjerner den separate leveringsadresseformular; shoppere får at vide, at "
"bestillinger går til deres faktureringsadresse."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:752
msgid "Charge shipping on subscriptions"
msgstr "Opkræv fragt på abonnementer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:753
msgid ""
"Collects a shipping address and adds a rate when a subscription product is "
"marked shippable."
msgstr ""
"Indsamler en leveringsadresse og tilføjer en pris, når et abonnementsprodukt "
"er markeret som afsendbart."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:761
msgid "Static methods charge per item"
msgstr "Statiske metoder opkræver pr. vare"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:762
msgid ""
"A static method’s rate is multiplied by the number of items instead of "
"charged once per order."
msgstr ""
"En statisk metodes sats ganges med antallet af varer i stedet for at blive "
"opkrævet én gang pr. bestilling."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:774
msgid "How rates fetched from a carrier are quoted and shown"
msgstr "Sådan bliver priser, der hentes fra et fragtfirma, tilbudt og vist"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:778
msgid "Show estimated delivery days"
msgstr "Vis anslåede leveringsdage"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:779
msgid ""
"Adds the carrier’s transit estimate after each live rate, where the carrier "
"provides one."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer transportørens transittestimat efter hver livepris, hvor "
"transportøren leverer en."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:788
msgid "Quote each item as its own parcel"
msgstr "Angiv hver vare som sin egen pakke"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:789
msgid ""
"Live rates are requested per item and added up, instead of one combined "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Livepriser anmodes om pr. artikel og lægges sammen i stedet for én "
"kombineret pakke."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:798
msgid "Always show overridden rates"
msgstr "Vis altid tilsidesatte satser"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:799
msgid ""
"A live rate you have replaced with a fixed amount is shown even when the "
"carrier returns no rate for the address. Off hides it in that case."
msgstr ""
"En livepris, du har erstattet med et fast beløb, vises, selv når "
"transportøren ikke returnerer nogen pris for adressen. Af skjuler det i så "
"fald."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:810
msgid "Carrier accounts"
msgstr "Speditørkonti"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:811
msgid ""
"USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, Canada Post and Australia Post credentials and origin "
"details. A carrier quotes once its details are complete."
msgstr ""
"USPS-, UPS-, FedEx-, DHL-, Canada Post- og Australia Post-"
"legitimationsoplysninger og oprindelsesoplysninger. Et fragtfirma giver et "
"tilbud, når oplysningerne er fuldstændige."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:817
msgid "Fraktjakt account"
msgstr "Fraktjaktkonto"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:818
msgid "Swedish carrier aggregator, used when the shipping method is Fraktjakt"
msgstr ""
"Svensk transportøraggregator, der anvendes, når forsendelsesmetoden er "
"Fraktjakt"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:823
msgid "Customer ID"
msgstr "Kunder"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:824
msgid "From your Fraktjakt account settings."
msgstr "Fra dine Fraktjakt-kontoindstillinger."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:833
msgid "Login key"
msgstr "Log på"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:834
msgid "The API login key from your Fraktjakt account. Keep it private."
msgstr "API-loginnøglen fra din Fraktjakt-konto. Hold det privat."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:843
msgid "Currency conversion rate"
msgstr "Valuta og omregningskurs"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:844
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to Fraktjakt’s SEK quotes to reach your store currency. "
"1.000 means no conversion."
msgstr ""
"Multiplikator anvendt på Fraktjakts SEK-tilbud for at nå din butiksvaluta. "
"1.000 betyder ingen omregning."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:858
msgid ""
"Sends quote requests to Fraktjakt’s test server. Turn off before taking real "
"orders."
msgstr ""
"Sender tilbudsforespørgsler til Fraktjakts testserver. Slå fra, før du "
"modtager rigtige bestillinger."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:869
msgid "Ship-from address"
msgstr "Afsender info"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:870
msgid ""
"The origin Fraktjakt quotes from. Other carriers take their origin details "
"in their own setup above."
msgstr ""
"Oprindelsen Fraktjakt citerer fra. Andre transportører tager deres "
"oprindelsesoplysninger i deres egen opsætning ovenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:875
msgid "Street address"
msgstr "Gadenavn og nr"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:876
msgid "Where parcels are collected from."
msgstr "Hvor pakker afhentes fra."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:894
msgid "State or province code"
msgstr "Stat eller Provins"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:895
msgid ""
"Two-character code, only if your country uses them. Leave empty otherwise."
msgstr "Kode på to tegn, kun hvis dit land bruger dem. Efterlad tom ellers."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:906
msgid "Postal code"
msgstr "Postnummer"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:916
msgid "Saved as the two-letter country code Fraktjakt expects."
msgstr "Gemt som den landekode på to bogstaver, som Fraktjakt forventer."

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:930
msgid "Shipping zones"
msgstr "Forsendelseszoner"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:931
msgid "Group countries and regions so a rate table can charge by destination"
msgstr ""
"Gruppelande og -regioner, så en pristabel kan opkræves efter destination"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:937
msgid "Ship-to countries & regions"
msgstr "Send til lande og regioner"

#: admin/template/settings/shipping-settings.php:938
msgid "Where you are willing to ship"
msgstr "Hvor du er villig til at sende"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:93 admin/template/settings/tax.php:268
msgid "Select a state"
msgstr "Vælg stat"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:123
msgid "Choose one first"
msgstr "Vælg en først"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:124
msgid "Enter a rate"
msgstr "Indtast en sats"

#. translators: %s: the place the rate is for, e.g. Canada.
#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "Delete the %s rate?"
msgstr "Vil du slette prisen på %s?"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:128
msgid "Orders already placed keep the tax they were charged."
msgstr ""
"Bestillinger, der allerede er afgivet, beholder den skat, de blev opkrævet."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:129
msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "Behold den"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:130
msgid "Delete rate"
msgstr "Slet sats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:131
msgid "Not saved"
msgstr "Ikke gemt"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:132
msgid "You have tax rates that are not saved."
msgstr "Du har skattesatser, der ikke gemmes."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:308
msgid "Save (Enter). Esc undoes."
msgstr "Gem (Enter). Esc fortryder."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:308
msgid "Save this row"
msgstr "Gem denne række"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:353 admin/template/settings/tax.php:391
#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:404
#: admin/template/settings/wizard/location.php:1991
msgid "State"
msgstr "Region"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:365
msgid "Edit this rate"
msgstr "(Rediger)"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:370
msgid "Save (Enter). Esc cancels."
msgstr "Gem (Enter). Esc annullerer."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:370
msgid "Save rate"
msgstr "Gem sats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:386
msgid ""
"One row per state or province. The rate applies when the shipping address is "
"in that state; a state with no row is not taxed."
msgstr ""
"En række pr. stat eller provins. Satsen gælder, når leveringsadressen er i "
"den pågældende stat; en stat uden række beskattes ikke."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:386
msgid ""
"One row per country. The rate applies when the shipping address is in that "
"country and no state rate matched first."
msgstr ""
"En række pr. land. Prisen gælder, når leveringsadressen er i det pågældende "
"land, og ingen statspris matches først."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:419 admin/template/settings/tax.php:430
msgid "Add a state rate"
msgstr "Tilføj en statssats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:419 admin/template/settings/tax.php:430
msgid "Add a country rate"
msgstr "Tilføj en landesats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:428
msgid "No state rates yet"
msgstr "Ingen statssatser endnu"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:428
msgid "No country rates yet"
msgstr "Ingen landepriser endnu"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:429
msgid ""
"Add one for each state or province you collect tax in. A state with no row "
"is not taxed."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en for hver stat eller provins, du opkræver skat i. En stat uden "
"række beskattes ikke."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:429
msgid ""
"Add one for each country you collect tax in. State rates are checked first, "
"then these."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en for hvert land, du opkræver skat i. Statens satser kontrolleres "
"først, derefter disse."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:468 admin/template/settings/tax.php:490
msgid "Apply to business"
msgstr "Ansøg til erhvervslivet"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:468
msgid "Apply to VAT-registered businesses"
msgstr "Ansøg om momsregistrerede virksomheder"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:483
msgid ""
"Rate per country, used once the shopper enters their country at checkout. "
"Countries not listed are not charged VAT. \"Apply to business\" charges the "
"country rate to VAT-registered businesses too, instead of the business rate."
msgstr ""
"Pris pr. land, der bruges, når kunden kommer ind i sit land ved kassen. "
"Lande, der ikke er angivet, opkræves ikke moms. \"Anvend på virksomheder\" "
"opkræver også landesatsen for momsregistrerede virksomheder i stedet for "
"virksomhedssatsen."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:502
msgid "No country rates yet. Add the first one below."
msgstr "Ingen landepriser endnu. Tilføj den første nedenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:530
msgid "GST"
msgstr "GST"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:530
msgid "PST"
msgstr "PST"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:530
msgid "HST"
msgstr "HST"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:534
msgid "Customer role"
msgstr "Kunderolle"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:540
msgid ""
"Tick the provinces you collect in for this role and set their rates in "
"percent. Ticks save straight away; rate changes save with the ✓ button or "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"Afkryds de provinser, du indsamler i for denne rolle, og angiv deres satser "
"i procent. Flåter gemmes med det samme; prisændringer gemmes med ✓ knappen "
"eller Enter."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:540
msgid ""
"Quebec: enter the QST ( 9.975% ) in the PST column. Shoppers, emails and "
"orders see it named QST ( TVQ in French ), and it is charged on the price "
"before GST, as Revenu Québec requires."
msgstr ""
"Quebec: Indtast QST ( 9,975% ) i PST-kolonnen. Shoppere, e-mails og "
"bestillinger ser det med navnet QST ( TVQ på fransk ), og det opkræves på "
"prisen før GST, som Revenu Québec kræver."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:547
msgid "Province"
msgstr "Provins"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:548 admin/template/settings/tax.php:558
msgid "Collect"
msgstr "Saml"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:599
msgid ""
"What tax you collect and where: a flat rate, rates by state or country, VAT, "
"Canadian GST/PST/HST, duty, or an automated service."
msgstr ""
"Hvilken skat du opkræver, og hvor: en fast sats, satser efter stat eller "
"land, moms, canadisk GST/PST/HST, told eller en automatiseret tjeneste."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:609
msgid "Where you collect"
msgstr "Hvor du indsamler"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:610
msgid "The base rules that apply to every order"
msgstr "Basisreglerne, der gælder for hver bestilling"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:614
msgid "Flat rate on every order"
msgstr "Fast pris på hver bestilling"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:615
msgid ""
"One rate on every taxable order, whatever the destination. Use rates by "
"state or country instead when tax depends on where you ship."
msgstr ""
"Én sats på hver afgiftspligtig bestilling, uanset destinationen. Brug satser "
"efter stat eller land i stedet, når skatten afhænger af, hvor du sender."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:623
msgid "Flat tax rate"
msgstr "Momssats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:624
msgid "Percentage charged on the taxable subtotal of every order."
msgstr ""
"Procentdel, der opkræves af den afgiftspligtige subtotal for hver bestilling."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:637
msgid "Charge tax on shipping"
msgstr "Opkræv skat på forsendelse"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:638
msgid ""
"Adds the shipping charge to the amount your flat, state, country and "
"Canadian rates apply to. Does not apply to TaxCloud."
msgstr ""
"Føjer forsendelsesgebyret til det beløb, som din faste, statslige, "
"landespecifikke og canadiske pris gælder for. Gælder ikke for TaxCloud."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:646
msgid "Rates by state"
msgstr "Priser efter stat"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:647
msgid "A rate for each state or province you collect in"
msgstr "En pris for hver stat eller provins, du indsamler i"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:653
msgid "Rates by country"
msgstr "Priser efter land"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:654
msgid "A rate for each country you collect in"
msgstr "En pris for hvert land, du indsamler i"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:661
msgid "Value added tax, one rate or a rate per country"
msgstr "Moms, én sats eller en sats pr. land"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:665
msgid "Charge VAT"
msgstr "Opkræv moms"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:666
msgid ""
"Adds VAT to orders. Choose below whether one rate applies everywhere or each "
"country has its own."
msgstr ""
"Tilføjer moms på bestillinger. Vælg nedenfor, om én pris gælder overalt, "
"eller om hvert land har sin egen."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:674
msgid "Rate varies by country"
msgstr "Satsen varierer efter land"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:675
msgid ""
"Uses the country rates in the table below once the shopper enters their "
"address. Off charges the default rate everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Bruger landesatserne i tabellen nedenfor, når kunden indtaster sin adresse. "
"Off opkræver standardprisen overalt."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:684
msgid "Default VAT rate"
msgstr "Standard momssats"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:685
msgid ""
"Charged before the shopper’s country is known, and everywhere when the rate "
"does not vary by country."
msgstr ""
"Opkræves, før køberens land er kendt, og overalt, hvor prisen ikke varierer "
"fra land til land."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:698
msgid "Prices include VAT"
msgstr "Priserne er inklusive moms"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:699
msgid ""
"Product prices are shown VAT-inclusive and the VAT portion is broken out at "
"checkout. Off adds VAT on top at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Produktpriserne vises inklusive moms, og momsdelen vises ved kassen. I rabat "
"lægges moms oven i ved kassen."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:708
msgid "Exempt shipping from VAT"
msgstr "Forsendelse er fritaget for moms"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:709
msgid ""
"Leaves the shipping charge out of the VAT total. Off charges VAT on shipping "
"too."
msgstr ""
"Efterlader forsendelsesgebyret uden for det samlede momsbeløb. Rabat "
"opkræver også moms på forsendelse."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:716
msgid "Rate for VAT-registered businesses"
msgstr "Sats for momsregistrerede virksomheder"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:717
msgid ""
"Charged instead of the country rate when a shopper enters a VAT registration "
"number at checkout and their country is not marked \"Apply to business\" "
"below. Needs the VAT number field turned on under Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Opkræves i stedet for landesatsen, når en kunde indtaster et "
"momsregistreringsnummer ved kassen, og vedkommendes land ikke er markeret "
"med \"Anvend på virksomhed\" nedenfor. Skal feltet Momsnummer være slået til "
"under Udtjekning."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:730
msgid "Verify VAT numbers with Vatlayer"
msgstr "Bekræft momsnumre med Vatlayer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:731
msgid ""
"Checks the VAT registration number a shopper enters at checkout against the "
"Vatlayer service before the business rate applies."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerer momsregistreringsnummeret, som en køber indtaster ved kassen, "
"mod Vatlayer-tjenesten, før virksomhedstaksten gælder."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:739
msgid "Vatlayer API key"
msgstr "Vatlayer API-nøgle"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:740
msgid ""
"From your Vatlayer account. Required for verification and the business rate."
msgstr "Fra din Vatlayer-konto. Kræves til verificering og forretningsrenten."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:748
msgid "Rounding increment"
msgstr "Afrundingsstigning"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:749
msgid ""
"VAT totals round to this amount. Most countries use 0.01; some require 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Momsen rundes af til dette beløb. De fleste lande bruger 0,01; nogle kræver "
"0,05."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:763
msgid "Canada GST/PST/HST"
msgstr "Canada GST/PST/HST"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:764
msgid "Provincial rates for orders shipped to Canada"
msgstr "Provinspriser for bestillinger, der sendes til Canada"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:768
msgid "Canadian provincial tax"
msgstr "Canadisk provinsskat"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:769
msgid ""
"Charges GST, PST or HST by province on orders shipped to Canada, with "
"separate rates per customer role. Turning it on ticks every province."
msgstr ""
"Opkræver GST, PST eller HST efter provins på bestillinger, der sendes til "
"Canada, med separate satser pr. kunderolle. At tænde den flåter alle "
"provinser."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:779
msgid "Duty"
msgstr "Afgift"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:780
msgid "A percentage on orders shipped abroad"
msgstr "En procentdel af bestillinger sendt til udlandet"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:784
msgid "Charge duty on international orders"
msgstr "Opkræv told på internationale ordrer"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:785
msgid ""
"Adds a duty percentage to orders shipped to any country other than the "
"exempt country below."
msgstr ""
"Føjer en toldprocent til bestillinger, der sendes til et andet land end det "
"fritagne land nedenfor."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:793
msgid "Duty-exempt country"
msgstr "Toldfritaget land"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:794
msgid "Usually your own country. Orders shipped here pay no duty."
msgstr ""
"Normalt dit eget land. Bestillinger, der afsendes her, betaler ingen told."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:797
msgid "None – every country pays duty"
msgstr "Ingen – alle lande betaler told"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:806
msgid "Duty rate"
msgstr "Told"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:807
msgid "Percentage charged on the taxable subtotal of orders that owe duty."
msgstr ""
"Procentdel, der opkræves af den afgiftspligtige subtotal af ordrer, der "
"skylder afgift."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:822
msgid "Automated tax services"
msgstr "Automatiserede skatteydelser"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:823
msgid "Live US rates from TaxCloud or TaxJar instead of your own tables"
msgstr ""
"Levende amerikanske priser fra TaxCloud eller TaxJar i stedet for dine egne "
"borde"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:828
msgid "TaxCloud"
msgstr "TaxCloud"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:829
msgid ""
"US sales tax by address. Active as soon as both the API ID and API key are "
"filled in."
msgstr ""
"Amerikansk omsætningsafgift efter adresse. Aktiv, så snart både API-ID og "
"API-nøgle er udfyldt."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:834
msgid "TaxCloud API ID"
msgstr "TaxCloud API-ID"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:835
msgid "From your TaxCloud account."
msgstr "Fra din TaxCloud-konto."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:842
msgid "TaxCloud API key"
msgstr "TaxCloud API-nøgle"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:843
msgid "From your TaxCloud account. Kept private; only sent from your server."
msgstr "Fra din TaxCloud-konto. Holdt privat; sendes kun fra din server."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:850
msgid "TaxCloud origin address"
msgstr "TaxCloud oprindelsesadresse"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:851 admin/template/settings/tax.php:937
msgid "Street address you ship from."
msgstr "Gadeadresse, du sender fra."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:858
msgid "TaxCloud origin city"
msgstr "TaxCloud oprindelse by"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:859 admin/template/settings/tax.php:946
msgid "City you ship from."
msgstr "By, du sender fra."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:866
msgid "TaxCloud origin state"
msgstr "TaxClouds oprindelsesstatus"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:867
msgid "State you ship from."
msgstr "Angiv, at du sender fra."

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:875
